<title>MALAYSIA: Cahya Mata at year high on requotation.</title>
<headline>Cahya Mata at year high on requotation.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Cahya Mata Sarawak Bhd hit a new high for the year on requotation after a one-day suspension.</p>
<p>The cement maker on Tuesday announced that net profit for the six-month period to June doubled to 51.24 million ringgit.</p>
<p>It also announced a proposal to acquire 100 percent of Concordance Holdings Sdn Bhd, the parent company of financial group BUMB Holdings Bhd.</p>
<p>Around 15 minutes after the opening, the stock was up 90 cents at 18.70 ringgit on 15,000 shares traded.</p>
<p>Its previous year-high was 18.20.</p>
